  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">계절별 별자리</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">별의 온도와 색깔과의 관계</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">분광형</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">밝기</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">거리 등을 학습한 후 각 반 별로 계절별 별자리를 제작해보는 활동입니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\"><strong>*준비물*</strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">4가지 색 LED, 동전전지, 스카치테이프, 구리테이프, 야광펜 또는 반짝이 싸인펜</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\"><strong>*활동방법*</strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\"></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. ‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">별자리표</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">어플과 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">네이버캐스트</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">별자리 여행</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">을 활용하여 모둠이 맡은 별자리에 관한 자료를 수집한다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">2. 각 별자리를 구성하고 있는 별들의 밝기</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">겉보기 등급</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">와 색깔을 색연필로 활동지에 그린다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">3.&nbsp;검은색 우드락에 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">LED</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">를 이용해 표현하도록 한다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">밝은 별은 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">LED</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">의 개수를 여러 개 구성하여 밝게 보이도록 하며</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">별의 색에 따라 다른 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">LED</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">를 연결하도록 한다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">주의점 : 건전지의 극과 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">LED</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">를 잘 연결하도록 지도한다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">별자리 이외에는 자유롭게 야광펜이나 반짝이 사인펜을 이용해 우주를 표현한다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">만들어진 각각의 별자리를 연결하면 하나의 계절 밤하늘을 표현하는 아름다운 협동 작품이 된다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/21747942589BD89416\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"650\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"LED 별자리.jpg\"  id=\"A_21747942589BD894162FD1\"/></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1269%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20170209120128&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile247.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F2223EF3F589BDB7C011378')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 지도안-LED별자리 만들기.hwp</a></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}